    "intuition": "Shift to a weighted ranking-aware pairwise margin loss that combines advantage gap signal with a sigmoid-based smooth margin and ranks weight contribution by relative rank gap, aggregating losses by weighted mean. This loss emphasizes pairs with higher rank gaps and adapts weighting dynamically to prioritize more informative comparisons.",
    "pseudocode": "rank_weight = clamp(1.0 + gamma * delta_rank, 0.1, 10.0)\nx = clamp(alpha * (lpw - lpl) - beta * advantage_gap, -20, 20)\nloss_per_pair = -logsigmoid(x)\nweighted_loss = loss_per_pair * weight * rank_weight\nloss = sum(weighted_loss) / (sum(weight * rank_weight) + epsilon)",
